  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674460",
      "title": "Server-side Form Handling via action()",
      "lectureOrder": 20,
      "videoOrder": 16,
      "sourceHash": "a83ec5873416b891525360a1524a8279ae2d9cc08b05e8177a3abe70c6919181",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.67,
          "end": 3.63,
          "en": "Because now we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.63,
          "end": 5.55,
          "en": "to add a new function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.55,
          "end": 9.21,
          "en": "to this notes.jsx file and we have to export it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.21,
          "end": 12.18,
          "en": "And this function must be called action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.18,
          "end": 14.28,
          "en": "This is a name Remix will be looking for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.28,
          "end": 16.77,
          "en": "just as it was looking for links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.77,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "And indeed there are a couple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 20.52,
          "en": "of special functions which you can export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.52,
          "end": 22.26,
          "en": "in your Route files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.26,
          "end": 25.83,
          "en": "Remix will be looking for and action is one of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.83,
          "end": 27.75,
          "en": "And you might notice action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.75,
          "end": 32.4,
          "en": "if you have worked with React router, version 6.4 or higher.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.4,
          "end": 36.84,
          "en": "But this action here in this Remix app will work differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.84,
          "end": 40.02,
          "en": "because with React router we had some client",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.02,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "side code that would be executed upon form submissions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 45.9,
          "en": "Now we'll have some backend code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.9,
          "end": 48.84,
          "en": "Whatever we put into this action function will run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.84,
          "end": 52.53,
          "en": "on the backend, on the server, not in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.53,
          "end": 54.99,
          "en": "And the codes defined in this action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.99,
          "end": 58.23,
          "en": "therefore will also not be downloaded to the client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 61.47,
          "en": "Remix will split the code and only execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 65.193,
          "en": "and store that code in this action function on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.54,
          "end": 69.87,
          "en": "But when exactly is this action function triggered?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.87,
          "end": 73.53,
          "en": "Well, it is triggered whenever a non GET request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.53,
          "end": 75.15,
          "en": "reaches this Route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.15,
          "end": 78.45,
          "en": "If a GET request reaches /notes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.45,
          "end": 80.73,
          "en": "it's simply the component that's returned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.73,
          "end": 82.56,
          "en": "so this page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.56,
          "end": 84.69,
          "en": "And a GET request is, for example, sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.69,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "if we just enter /notes and we enter here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 90.53399999999999,
          "en": "or if we click a link that leads to /notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.53399999999999,
          "end": 93.27000000000001,
          "en": "If a non GET request reaches this Route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.27000000000001,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "like a POST request, which is what we're sending here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 98.72999999999999,
          "en": "from this form, then it's actually the action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.72999999999999,
          "end": 100.62,
          "en": "function that will be triggered instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.62,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "of the component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.47999999999999,
          "end": 104.91,
          "en": "And here in this action function, we can then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.91,
          "end": 108.03,
          "en": "execute our server side code that extracts the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.03,
          "end": 111.09,
          "en": "submitted data and maybe stores it in a database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.09,
          "end": 113.75999999999999,
          "en": "or in a file or whatever you want to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.75999999999999,
          "end": 117.47999999999999,
          "en": "For that attached you find a notes.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 120.75,
          "en": "And in the app folder you should add a new data folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.75,
          "end": 123.18,
          "en": "This folder name again is totally up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.18,
          "end": 126.78,
          "en": "and not reserved, but I'll put my notes.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.78,
          "end": 129.843,
          "en": "which is attached to this lecture into this data folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.77,
          "end": 134.52,
          "en": "Now in this notes.js file, I just got some utility functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.52,
          "end": 139.52,
          "en": "for reading data from a file and for storing data in a file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.65,
          "end": 142.563,
          "en": "in a notes.json file to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.09,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "Now we could be interacting with a database here and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 150.24,
          "en": "in most apps you probably will, but to keep things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.24,
          "end": 153.69,
          "en": "simple here, we'll just use this file as a storage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.69,
          "end": 155.97,
          "en": "because it doesn't really matter what we use here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.97,
          "end": 158.19299999999998,
          "en": "The Remix code is not affected by that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "Now we just have to add a notes.json file here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 164.61,
          "en": "on the Route level of this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 164.61,
          "end": 167.37,
          "en": "So next to the package.json file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 167.37,
          "end": 171.48,
          "en": "and this notes.json file will receive an empty object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.48,
          "end": 172.98,
          "en": "if you want to call it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.98,
          "end": 177.98,
          "en": "where I add notes, which is an empty array initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.35,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "Now this is the JSON file format here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 184.78,
          "en": "and we should have this initial structure in notes.json",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.08,
          "end": 190.38,
          "en": "Now with that added back in notes.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.38,
          "end": 193.53,
          "en": "we can interact with this notes.json file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.53,
          "end": 195.81,
          "en": "with help of these utility methods stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.81,
          "end": 198.45,
          "en": "in notes.js the data folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.45,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "And that is indeed exactly what we'll do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 201.633,
          "en": "over the next minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
